# 保留现有源码行尾；仅约束 Windows 批处理文件并标记二进制资源。
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 明确标记二进制资源，禁止 Git 尝试转换行尾。
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
